er each race, visit the shop to grab new mods, unlock special abilities, or grab powerful one-time boosts. Every run is procedurally generated - no two races are ever the same. Build your strategy, modify your car, and push for the longest streak you can. How far will your build take you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/60584acf6e6ecc1d501ea84ae7667a32.poster.avif?t=1760105438\" width=616 height=353 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/60584acf6e6ecc1d501ea84ae7667a32.webm?t=1760105438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlockables!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your garage with a lineup of unique cars \u2014 each with its own handling and flair.\u00a0Personalise your ride with striking vinyls and stand out on every road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/b95a7b004a032741af7fc0589d9c2473.poster.avif?t=1760105438\" width=616 height=353 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/b95a7b004a032741af7fc0589d9c2473.webm?t=1760105438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >London at Night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience riding through a neon-clad London at night, with all the iconic vehicles and spots for you to find and... mainly avoid. Accompanied by a diverse soundtrack that complements the game's nocturnal adrenaline-filled action. There's always something new to see and a fresh challenge to attempt, so there's no shortage of roads to master &amp; places to visit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/f8949d09583956d778fdc825c06c6704.poster.avif?t=1760105438\" width=616 height=353 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/f8949d09583956d778fdc825c06c6704.webm?t=1760105438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Never Ending Fun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase the perfect run across a neon-fueled world. Beat your high scores, unlock new cars, collect achievements, and refine your strategy with every attempt. With Eurobeat-inspired tracks and a stylish, glowing world, drifting has never felt this smooth or this addictive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/1381013f9df265c6f8a1c4abc1a5ed01.avif?t=1760105438\" width=616 height=37 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","developers":["Gravity Works"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/34039a9121d128753aa5713b096f929c3c264ac2/header.jpg?t=1760105438","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2024 Blue Gravity Studios z o.o. Published under license by Blue Gravity Games Inc. NeuraDrift\u2122 and its associated logos are trademarks of Blue Gravity Studios z o.o. Blue Gravity Games\u2122 and the Blue Gravity Games logo are trademarks of Blue Gravity Games Inc. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requiremen